 "c": [
  {"i":2405,"t":["actions"],"s":{"4":["relationships"]},"n":"Hobby tinkering (車をいじる) is still fiddling with things; only the teasing sense needs its own entry."},
  {"i":2431,"t":["movement"],"s":{"2":["thinking"],"3":["business"]},"n":"頭の回転が速い is very common, so the mind sense gets thinking; turnover of goods or customers stays business."},
  {"i":2433,"t":["character","relationships"],"n":"Mostly said of people (信用できる人), so it is a trait and a matter of trust between people."},
  {"i":2442,"t":["calendar","function"],"s":{"2":["time"]},"n":"A question word for dates; 'how many days' asks about duration, so that sense goes to time."},
  {"i":2484,"t":["time","calendar"],"n":"Mainly a duration (一週間かかる), so time comes first and calendar second."},
  {"i":2496,"t":["school","thinking"],"n":"Learners meet it as mastering a skill or language (日本語をものにする); the 'secure' sense fits no clearer unit."},
  {"i":2504,"t":["time"],"s":{"2":["movement"]},"n":"Passing through a place (東京を経て大阪へ) is a common, separate sense, so it gets movement."},
  {"i":2527,"t":["numbers"],"s":{"2":["measures"]},"n":"The counter for train cars is taught with counters; transport is only a loose association."}
 ],
 "d": [
  {"i":2405,"keep":[],"n":"The 'tease' sense is slangy and colloquial; the word is taught for fiddling and touching, not in a relationships unit."},
  {"i":2406,"keep":[],"n":"At this level 試験 means exam; science units teach 実験 for experiment, and 'trial' appears mostly in compounds."},
  {"i":2412,"keep":[2],"n":"'Bring up a topic' (話を持ち出す) is a common use and fits a communication unit."},
  {"i":2414,"keep":[],"n":"Bending already fits the physical-action labels; a qualities entry would suit the 'crooked' sense more, and it is not needed."},
  {"i":2416,"keep":[2],"n":"A scene in a film or play is a common sense and belongs in arts."},
  {"i":2424,"keep":[3],"n":"Year-end (年の暮れ, お暮れ) is a core use taught with the calendar."},
  {"i":2427,"keep":[4],"n":"Being physically worn out (体がボロボロ) is a very common everyday use and fits physical states."},
  {"i":2431,"keep":[2],"n":"頭の回転が速い is a common set phrase for thinking; 'turnover' of goods or funds is advanced business vocabulary."},
  {"i":2435,"keep":[],"n":"Sales or distribution channel (販売ルート) is beyond learner level."},
  {"i":2442,"keep":[2],"n":"'How many days' is a duration question, distinct from the date question, and is taught with time."},
  {"i":2449,"keep":[2,4],"n":"Taking up a topic and featuring something in the news (ニュースで取り上げる) are both common and unit-worthy."},
  {"i":2451,"keep":[2],"n":"しゅ as species (絶滅危惧種) is a standard science and biology sense."},
  {"i":2456,"keep":[2],"n":"Sensitivity (神経質, 神経を使う) is a common emotional sense."},
  {"i":2461,"keep":[],"n":"Fungo hitting is specialist baseball jargon and rare for learners."},
  {"i":2464,"keep":[2],"n":"Screen display (画面に表示) is a very common technology use."},
  {"i":2466,"keep":[],"n":"'Despise' is figurative, and 見下す is the usual word for it."},
  {"i":2471,"keep":[3],"n":"Dissolution of the Diet (衆議院解散) is frequent in news and taught in society; organisation break-up is not specifically a business sense."},
  {"i":2474,"keep":[2],"n":"Main dish (メイン料理) is common on menus and in restaurants."},
  {"i":2491,"keep":[],"n":"Strumming strings belongs to the reading ひく; with the reading はじく this sense is rare."},
  {"i":2504,"keep":[],"n":"'Pass through' is mostly 〜を経て about a process; the place sense is covered by 経由 and is not a movement unit word."},
  {"i":2511,"keep":[2],"n":"'Drawing near' in time (試験が間近) is a very common use."},
  {"i":2527,"keep":[2],"n":"The counter for train cars (〜両) is common and belongs in measures."},
  {"i":2528,"keep":[4],"n":"Notebook PC (ノートパソコン, ノート) is very common in technology."},
  {"i":2531,"keep":[2],"n":"Harbouring feelings or thoughts (不安を抱く, 疑問を抱く) is the main use of the reading いだく."},
  {"i":2537,"keep":[2],"n":"Wearing or carrying things on the body is a common sense taught with clothing."},
  {"i":2539,"keep":[6],"n":"Clearing a game or level (ゲームをクリア) is very common for learners and fits hobbies."}
 ]
